# Downloaded dependencies live here and none of them are committed.
#
# PER-DIRECTORY, like every other ignore file in this tree: the rule belongs
# where it applies, and the root file's patterns are anchored so they do not
# reach in here by accident.
#
# angle/ is what tools/fetch-angle.sh unpacks - a pinned release from
# github.com/alexios-angel/angle, about 40 MB of libraries and headers. It is
# fetched rather than built because ANGLE needs GN, depot_tools and, on Windows,
# clang-cl and the Windows SDK; see docs/angle-plan.md.
angle/
